-- Migration 024: ingest@1.4.0 — single-character @handles are redacted
-- (Copilot 4129565702 on PR #10).
--
-- ingest@1.3.0's HANDLE_RE required at least two characters after the "@",
-- so "@a" was stored in the text. 1.4.0 redacts a handle of one or more
-- characters (src/collectors/identity.js); nothing else changes. Released
-- rows are never edited: ingest@1.3.0 (migration 017) keeps its row; this
-- is a NEW version, and posts record the version they were stored under
-- (raw_posts.ingest_mv_id, migration 022).
--
-- The INSERT below is generated by:
--   node scripts/generate-methodology-migration.js ingest@1.4.0
-- and mirrors src/config/methodology-registry.js FIELD FOR FIELD
-- (tests/unit/pure/methodologyRegistry.test.js parses this file).

-- ingest@1.4.0
